<Page
  title="Antarctical"
  description="A native Google Calendar app for the Linux desktop."
>
  <p>
    Antarctical is a native Google Calendar app for the Linux desktop. It shows
    the calendars of one or more Google accounts in month, week, day and agenda
    views, puts today's agenda in the system tray, and notifies you of event
    reminders.
  </p>
  <p>
    It runs entirely on your computer and talks to Google directly. Your calendar
    data never passes through our servers, and Antarctical has no analytics or
    telemetry.
  </p>
